    "enUS": {
      "description": "Now that you've recovered all the mail, you can take it all back with you to Mount Hyjal!\r\n\r\nShould be no problem, right?",
      "dialogue": {
        "0149be3767e9c2cc87bd": "Ah, you've returned with mail from abroad! I'll make sure this is distributed to the correct people. Thank you so much.\n\nWe've all been so busy with problems up here that nobody has time for the mundane details!",
        "86785a2678396bc9da23": "Have you finished the trip?"
      },
      "summary": "Take mail from Everlook up to Innkeeper Sebelia on the summit of Mount Hyjal.",
      "title": "Top of the Post",
